      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Email Intake & Pre-Processing\n\nCaptures incoming customer emails and normalizes the payload. Downstream nodes strictly depend on the standard `Edit Fields` schema rather than the raw trigger output, providing a mockable injection point for isolated branch testing without unwanted I/O side-effects.",
