    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "##  Semantic Router (LLM)\n\nActs as the primary intent classifier to prevent AI hallucinations across domains. Uses Groq for high-speed classification to route support queries to the AI Agent, high-value leads to human sales, and policy exceptions to escalation, while safely dropping spam.",
        "height": 250,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 5
      },
      "id": "fe5d989e-ee23-44bb-8064-678c13cb8cd3",
      "name": "Note: Routing",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -2368,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Internal Handoffs (No-Op for AI)\n\nRoutes non-support intents (Sales & Escalations) to human-in-the-loop channels. Designed purely for internal notification rather than blocking approval\u2014ensures the AI agent is not burdened with unsupported tasks while keeping core systems responsive.",
        "height": 350,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 2
      },
      "id": "dfbad847-cc02-4fe4-b517-cfcebd6b1122",
